# Generated from the OSRS Wiki page "Transcript:Cold War" by tools/quests/transcript_to_dialogue.py
0	section	Getting started
0	section	Speaking to Larry at Ardougne Zoo
1	line	Player	Hello. Do you need any help? I'm looking for a quest.
1	line	Larry	Are you working for them?
1	line	Player	Uh, I'm not sure. Who are they?
1	line	Larry	EXACTLY!
1	line	Player	Seriously, what are you talking about?
1	line	Larry	I think you can be trusted. What do you know about...
1	line	Larry	penguins?
1	line	Player	Uh...they live in the cold? That's about all.
1	line	Larry	Would you like to learn more about them? I'm conducting a, uh, research project, to, uh, learn about their social habits in their natural environment.
1	line	Player	What do you need my help for?
1	line	Larry	Well, I need to build a shelter to hide from view, and it's always useful to have an extra pair of eyes, you know, for, uh, observing...Penguins.
1	line	Larry	So, are you up for it?
1	option	Okay, why not!
2	line	Player	Okay, why not! But first, who are you and why are you researching penguins?
2	line	Larry	I, uh, was a zoo keeper here. But, I, uh, am on leave to go research penguins in their native habitat.
2	line	Player	Ok! Okay then. So, what did you need me to do?
2	line	Larry	Right. I need you to gather materials for the bird hide, while I arrange for our transport.
2	line	Larry	You need to get 10 oak planks, 10 steel nails, a hammer, and a spade so that we can build a bird hide.
2	line	Larry	Once you have those, meet me up by the entrance to Keldagrim, east of Rellekka. I'll be there with a boat to take us to our destination.
2	line	Player	Right, oak planks, steel nails, hammer, spade, east of Rellekka. Got it.
2	action	end
1	option	I don't think so.
2	line	Player	I don't think so.
2	action	end
