2	line	Larry	The book will explain how to make the suit. But, since you seem to lazy to read it, I'll summarise.
2	line	Larry	Take the materials to your house and use the Crafting table to make clockwork toys. From there you can make the suit.
2	line	Player	Okay, thanks.
2	action	end
