3	action	end
2	line	Pong	Dude, good job on the instruments. Just let us set up and we'll get going.
2	action	
2	line	Pong	And a 1 and a 2 and a 3...
2	line	Ping	Wait, wait. It needs more cowbell.
2	line	Pong	You're right, man. Let's try this again!
2	action	(Ping and Pong begin playing their instruments)
2	line	Pong	There once was a Pescallion, who travelled in a galleon.
2	line	Ping	Our Pescallion went exploring and found this iceberg
2	line	Pong	He travelled the world, until his toes curled.
2	line	Ping	Upon an iceberg he came, and our lives were never the same.
2	line	Pong	As an outpost it was approved, so here our people moved.
2	line	Ping	To grow and learn, though our hearts did yearn...
2	line	Pong	For the motherland.
2	line	Ping	Deep inside the 'berg lay a threat, but don't fret!
2	line	Pong	For Pescaling Pax trapped those monsters behind a gate, but let's hope they don't mate.
2	line	Pong	Now we have no fear
2	line	Pong	But shed a small tear for the motherland.
2	action	(The gate's KGP Agent enters the room)
2	line	KGP Agent	All right, that's enough racket.
2	line	KGP Agent	Shut those instruments up or I'm throwing you in solitary!
2	line	KGP Agent	I don't care if your vibes are harmonious!
2	line	Player	Now might be a good time for me to slip out and get through those doors...
2	action	(Player quietly leaves the room)
2	action	end
1	option	No.
2	line	Player	No.
2	action	end
0	section	Entering the secret room
1	line	Pescaling Pax	And we'll move this little penguin here...and KABLOOM! Heee hee.
1	action	(Player is transformed back to human)
1	line	Pescaling Pax	It appears we have a visitor!
1	line	Pescaling Pax	Haa haa! I am glad we installed that anti-magic security. What have we here?
1	action	
1	line	Pescaling Pax	What an ingenious little device. This will solve all our problems. Scientists! Come examine this; we have much work to do.
1	line	Player	What about me?
1	line	Pescaling Pax	Hmm, take that human to the Ice Lords. They'll enjoy the exercise.
