1	line	Player	Err... Nothing. Just checking that your cowbell was working. Don't want you to get lost!
1	line	Dairy cow	How exactly am I going to get lost when I'm tied down? What were yooo really doing?
1	line	Player	I don't think you'll believe me.
1	line	Dairy cow	I'm a talking cow, I'll believe almost anything.
1	line	Player	Fine. I need the bell to trick some penguins into helping me get into their secret lair.
